Resource           resources/robot/CB010767_SR_A_RedCap_UE_20Mhz_SA_FDD_n1_keywords.robot


Suite Setup        Suite Setup From Scratch
...                keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}    #set in comment for robustness cfg file to 200 ue
